<section class="pv2-page-hero"><div class="pv2-container"><span class="pv2-eyebrow">ACCESSIBILITY</span><h1 style="max-width:850px">Banking information should be usable by as many people as possible.</h1><p style="max-width:760px">Velmora’s redesign is being built with clearer structure, responsive layouts and more consistent interaction patterns. This statement describes the direction without claiming a certification that has not been independently tested.</p></div></section>
